      "content": "Open Food Facts is a collaborative, free, and open database of food products from around the world. The HTTP API provides read access to product data by barcode, full-text and faceted search, and access to Open Food Facts taxonomies.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Open Food Facts\n Email: reuse@openfoodfacts.org",
